OUpUMUZn\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1",null,null,"2ahUKEwiYosej956YAxWumysGHU3aMb4Q_2MoAXoECAMQPA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4620038718559541748/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLUlUxRlJYZFhSVkl6WkVaV2QyUlVSbFZPTW14RlRrUlNXbVJJWXhBQhAA"],null,["en"],[["Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback. We’re very sorry to hear about the ongoing issues you’ve experienced with your truck. It’s understandably frustrating when a vehicle you rely on has repeated problems.\nWe do want to clarify that your vehicle has not been in our service department previously. When you contacted us to set an appointment, our team explained that towing is not something we can provide directly. We apologize if this was unclear or caused additional frustration.\nOur goal is always to help our customers through the repair process as smoothly as possible. If you would like, we’d be happy to assist in connecting you with Ford Roadside Assistance and making sure everything is in place for your appointment here at Champion Ford. Please don’t hesitate to reach out to us directly.  We want to do everything we can to get you back on the road.",null,[0,221]]]],[null,null,1067,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KRU1FRXdXRVIzZEZWd2RURlVOMmxFTkRSWmRIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6825e3b6449303de!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJEMEEwWER3dFVwdTFUN2lENDRZdHc%7C%7C?hl\u003den-US"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KRU1FRXdXRVIzZEZWd2RURlVOMmxFTkRSWmRIYxAB\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d1\u0026wv\u003d1",null,null,"2ahUKEwiYosej956YAxWumysGHU3aMb4QoykoAnoECAMQPQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjTstmj956YAxXOTcIBHXYOAKsQ0pMFCA0oAw"],null,null,null,"2ahUKEwiYosej956YAxWumysGHU3aMb4Q0pMFKAN6BAgDEDo"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkMEtQa3FnRRAB",["0x0:0x6825e3b6449303de",null,1707535283580493,1707535283580493,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101124524141906884798/reviews?hl\u003den-US"],null,null,["Mitch O.","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV91rFkJD-GfaTulISebRFr_tcJlOCxmack3P8u9GCnelAOcMPs\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101124524141906884798?hl\u003den-US"],"101124524141906884798",null,166,644,null,[1,7,1],31,["Local Guide · 166 reviews",null,null,null,null,[null,"2ahUKEwiYosej956YAxWumysGHU3aMb4Qpr8GKAB6BAgDED8"]]]],null,"2 years ago",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["en"],[["Drew was our sales consultant, he did a great job explaining the vehicle and very personable. Even though we came towards the end of the business day, the team stayed late to complete all the necessary  paperwork and get us on our way. They are a top notch dealership,  I highly recommend them.",null,[0,294]]]],[null,1707584723000000,1707584723000000,"2 years ag